### Why Stone, Not Slate?

Slate (blue-tinted gray) is the default in Tailwind and every SaaS site. Stone (warm neutral gray) gives CelebBoard's light sections a gallery/editorial warmth — like high-end paper stock. The amber accent pops harder against warm neutrals than cold ones.

