### Grid System

**Cinematic Split uses an asymmetric grid, NOT a uniform 12-column system.**

```
FULL-BLEED SECTIONS (hero, photo backgrounds):
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                    100vw, no container                   │
│    Content overlay uses max-w-7xl (1280px) + px-6       │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

CONTAINED SECTIONS:
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│  px-6 (mobile) │ max-w-7xl (1280px) centered │ px-6    │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

ASYMMETRIC SPLIT — the signature layout:
├────────────────────────┬──────────────────┤
│    60% (image/visual)  │   40% (text)     │  ← Default
├────────────────────────┴──────────────────┤
├──────────────────┬────────────────────────┤
│   40% (text)     │   60% (image/visual)   │  ← Reversed
├──────────────────┴────────────────────────┤

In CSS grid: grid-cols-5 → image: col-span-3, text: col-span-2
Or reversed: text: col-span-2, image: col-span-3

EDGE-TO-EDGE FEATURES (no gap between items):
├─────────┬─────────┬─────────┤
│  Card 1 │  Card 2 │  Card 3 │  ← gap-0, border between items
├─────────┴─────────┴─────────┤
```

