## 7. Imagery & Photography Direction

### Product Screenshots

Product screenshots are STRUCTURAL, not decorative. They appear in:

1. **Hero**: TV dashboard mockup floating on right side of split hero
2. **How It Works split**: Full-height dashboard in left 60% column
3. **Product Showcase split**: Dashboard in right 60% column (dark bg)

**Treatment rules:**
- Screenshots sit in a simple border frame: `2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08)` on dark, `1px solid #E7E5E4` on light
- 0px border radius (sharp edges)
- On dark backgrounds: subtle warm glow behind → `radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(245,158,11,0.1), transparent 60%)`
- On light backgrounds: subtle shadow → `shadow-lg shadow-stone-200/50`
- Caption below in `text-xs` stone-400: "Dashboard view" or "Live celebration overlay"

### Ambient Photography Textures

The hero and CTA sections use ambient "office" textures — not stock photos, but abstract textures that suggest an office environment:

```css
/* Subtle grid/office texture overlay on dark sections */
.texture-grid {
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 25%, transparent 25%),
    linear-gradient(-45deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 25%, transparent 25%);
  background-size: 20px 20px;
}

/* Noise texture overlay for depth */
.texture-noise {
  /* Apply via a pseudo-element at low opacity */
  background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,...");
  opacity: 0.03;
}
```

### Team Member Photos

In product screenshots and testimonials, team member photos are the ONLY round elements:
- Always `rounded-full` (the single exception to 0px radius)
- Bordered: `border-2 border-dark-900` on dark, `border-2 border-white` on light
- Sizes: 20px (in dashboard), 28px (in testimonials), 40px (standalone)

