## 8. Motion & Animation

### Principles

Cinematic Split animation should feel like a **camera revealing a scene**, not elements bouncing in.

1. **Reveal, don't enter.** Elements fade in from slight opacity/translate, as if the camera is panning to them — not flying in from offscreen.
2. **Horizontal reveals for split layouts.** Left-side content reveals from left, right from right. This reinforces the asymmetric split.
3. **No bounce. No wiggle.** Sharp easing curves. `cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)` — fast start, smooth settle.
4. **Respect the grid.** Confetti particles in the product mockup can be playful. Marketing page animations are cinematic.

### Scroll Animations

```css
/* Base: invisible, slightly translated */
[data-animate] {
  opacity: 0;
  transform: translateY(20px);
  transition: opacity 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),
              transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
}

[data-animate].is-visible {
  opacity: 1;
  transform: translateY(0);
}

/* Horizontal reveal for split layouts */
[data-animate="from-left"] {
  transform: translateX(-30px);
}
[data-animate="from-left"].is-visible {
  transform: translateX(0);
}

[data-animate="from-right"] {
  transform: translateX(30px);
}
[data-animate="from-right"].is-visible {
  transform: translateX(0);
}

/* Stagger children */
[data-animate-children] > *:nth-child(1) { transition-delay: 0ms; }
[data-animate-children] > *:nth-child(2) { transition-delay: 100ms; }
[data-animate-children] > *:nth-child(3) { transition-delay: 200ms; }
[data-animate-children] > *:nth-child(4) { transition-delay: 300ms; }
```

### Hover Interactions

```css
/* Buttons: sharp lift */
button:hover {
  transform: translateY(-1px);
  transition: transform 0.15s ease;
}

/* Cards: subtle lift + border shift */
.card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  transition: all 0.2s ease;
}

/* Ghost links: arrow slides right */
.ghost-link:hover .arrow {
  transform: translateX(4px);
  transition: transform 0.15s ease;
}

/* Logo bar: opacity increase */
.logo-bar img:hover {
  opacity: 0.6;
  transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
}
```

### Ambient Motion

```css
/* Warm glow pulse on hero (very subtle) */
@keyframes glow-pulse {
  0%, 100% { opacity: 0.12; }
  50% { opacity: 0.18; }
}

.hero-glow {
  animation: glow-pulse 6s ease-in-out infinite;
}

/* Logo bar marquee on mobile */
@keyframes marquee {
  0% { transform: translateX(0); }
  100% { transform: translateX(-50%); }
}

.logo-marquee {
  animation: marquee 30s linear infinite;
}
```

### Reduced Motion

```css
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  [data-animate],
  [data-animate="from-left"],
  [data-animate="from-right"] {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
    transition: none;
  }
  .hero-glow { animation: none; }
  .logo-marquee { animation: none; }
}
```

